    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 写出回路传递函数 G D_cl(s)。2. 确定位于原点的极点数（积分器数）n。3. 系统为 n 型。4. 计算相应的误差常数：当 n=0 时，K_p = lim_{s->0} G D_cl(s)；当 n=1 时，K_v = lim_{s->0} s G D_cl(s)；当 n=2 时，K_a = lim_{s->0} s^2 G D_cl(s)。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. Write the loop transfer function G D_cl(s). 2. Determine n, the number of poles at the origin (integrators). 3. The system is Type n. 4. Compute the relevant error constant: K_p = lim_{s->0} G D_cl(s) for n=0, K_v = lim_{s->0} s G D_cl(s) for n=1, K_a = lim_{s->0} s^2 G D_cl(s) for n=2.",
